      "writtenOn": "2020-09-30T23:07:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently, the kernel is using \"ectool usbpd\" to collect pretty prints of the port information.  Prashant can verify, but I was guessing they\u0027d prefer to be able to run the same command regardless of TCPM version.  If that\u0027s not a desired use, I can abandon this CL.  \n\nPrashant, thoughts here?",
